    "CoiStatement": "Keith T. Corpus, MD, Samuel A. Taylor, MD, Stephen J. O\u2019Brien, MD, MBA, and Lawrence V. Gulotta, MD have declared that they have no conflict of interest. Human/Animal Rights All procedures followed were in accordance with the ethical standards of the responsible committee on human experimentation (institutional and national) and with the Helsinki Declaration of 1975, as revised in 2008 (5). Informed Consent Informed consent was waived from all patients for being included in the study. Required Author Forms Disclosure forms provided by the authors are available with the online version of this article.",
    "Article": {
      "Pagination": {"MedlinePgn": "200-208"},
